{
  "$comment": "Connection URI test vectors (MANUAL.md, Connection URIs). Every driver parses each `valid` URI to the fields given (null when absent; `url` has no trailing slash) and refuses each `invalid` one. Hosts are lowercased; option names ignore case.",
